        new Card("Club", 8)
    ).collect(Collectors.toList());

Card.shuffle(cards);

System.out.println(cards.get(0).compareTo(cards.get(1)));
```

This would print `1` if the first card is stronger, `-1` if the second card is stronger, or `0` if they are equal.

